  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/05/P1018640.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">(30 fotos) House Cafe, en la calle Comare Elisa Meseguer, 2 de Onda, ha acogido nuevamente la noche de este s&aacute;bado&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">cena, a partir de las 21 horas, y&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/05/P1018664.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">baile posterior con bachatas, salsa, merengue, cha cha cha, foxtrot, cumbia, sevillanas, tango o rock. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">Una nueva sesi&oacute;n de cena y baile est&aacute; previst para el s&aacute;bado 19 de mayo. Las reservas se pueden realizar en el tel&eacute;fono 964 63 93 45.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparballhousecafe050518/p1018639.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparballhousecafe050518/p1018640.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparballhousecafe050518/p1018641.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparballhousecafe050518/p1018642.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparballhousecafe050518/p1018644.jp